A little hint for the future:
Whenever I survive long enough to find the vibrating square, I drop the
Candelabrum (already loaded with candles) and the Bell next to the
stairs on the vibrating square until I have killed Rodney and come back
with the Book.
I know I don't need them before coming back with the book, and when I
drop them on the VS level, I don't lose them or get them cursed before
coming back.
I generally want to keep all stairs visible, so I don't drop stuff on
them. But I don't want to drop those items too far away from the stairs
either, otherwise some monster may get them before I do.

